WEBVTT

00:01:30.610 --> 00:01:32.590
Habit is terrifying.

00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:37.710
I can't believe a person could grow accustomed
to this abnormal style...

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:41.750
Quit complaining, you runaway.

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:44.040
I didn't run away...

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:45.420
Wait.

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:53.140
What is that? You're not going
to sleep with it, are you?

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:56.560
It's a cat?

00:02:09.220 --> 00:02:10.380
Hey.

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:12.280
You still have something to say?

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:14.390
You're not going to ask?

00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:16.260
Ask what?

00:02:16.890 --> 00:02:19.050
How long I intend to stay here.

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:24.590
I'm not running away,
but... why I'm here.

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:27.440
If you don't want to talk about
it, you don't have to.

00:02:28.050 --> 00:02:30.860
Besides, I already know.

00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:32.060
What?

00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:39.570
Good night, Tomoko-chan.

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:47.360
Good night, Onii-chan.

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:50.450
Light Yellow Distance

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:07.170
Whoops. September's almost over.

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:10.170
Sports Festival & Elis' Birthday

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:10.170
I'll hit you 100 times if you forget!!

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:22.270
Here is the sports festival program.

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:24.150
Don't forget to bring them with you.

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:26.580
Relay

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:26.580
Obstacle Course

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:26.580
Tug of War

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:26.580
A relay, huh?

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:29.400
And I'm the anchor. This sucks!

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:32.070
You were chosen while you were absent.

00:03:32.070 --> 00:03:34.340
If you're going to blame anyone,
blame yourself.

00:03:35.710 --> 00:03:37.810
Hosen, don't worry!

00:03:37.810 --> 00:03:40.030
I'll cheer you on!

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:45.610
With this much of a gap
between you again...

00:03:45.610 --> 00:03:48.120
that run once around the track
must have been refreshing.

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:49.540
Don't you think so, Shota-kun?

00:04:14.010 --> 00:04:18.000
Don't you think your diet's
pretty unbalanced?

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:19.670
Kiri...

00:04:20.770 --> 00:04:23.680
I can't be bothered to cook
breakfast for just one.

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:26.060
Breakfast for one? What about Elis?

00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:28.480
She went to stay at Fujinami's place.

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:29.610
Since when?

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:32.690
I think it's almost been a week.

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:37.860
I see. Those two must be good friends.

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:43.140
Well, I'm sure she'll be home
soon to collect her presents.

00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:44.840
Presents?

00:04:48.030 --> 00:04:50.870
Training on your own must be hard.

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:53.980
I'm glad I'm doing the scavenger hunt.

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:56.210
Yeah, this sucks...

00:04:58.240 --> 00:05:01.270
How's our anchor doing?

00:05:01.270 --> 00:05:03.270
Fine.

00:05:03.270 --> 00:05:08.790
Hiroki told me the day of the sports
festival is also your birthday.

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:15.030
I'm currently accepting
requests for presents.

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:18.210
Oh, thanks.

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:30.540
I was thinking we could focus on yellow.

00:05:30.540 --> 00:05:33.430
It's reminiscent of the spark of youth.

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:36.350
President, how old are you?

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:42.900
Hosen-san, could you paint
the main figure?

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:44.450
Okay.

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:49.750
What's wrong, Takeuchi?

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:52.100
It's nothing.

00:05:54.150 --> 00:05:56.190
I'll leave some water here.

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:59.440
You don't need to do that.

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:01.270
It's fine. Don't mind me.

00:06:01.270 --> 00:06:03.550
Just focus on your painting.

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:05.980
Okay, thanks.

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:09.600
Why don't you exaggerate this part?

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:12.120
It should be full of life.

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:14.190
Elis...

00:06:17.380 --> 00:06:21.860
Art club members, how are
things coming along?

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:25.420
Hagino and Misaki. Do
you need something?

00:06:25.420 --> 00:06:26.710
Take a look at this!

00:06:27.870 --> 00:06:29.000
You're flat as a board.

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:31.840
That's not what I meant.

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:34.610
It says I'm a member of the sports
festival planning committee!

00:06:35.230 --> 00:06:36.240
I see.

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:41.580
Compared to the cultural festival,
this sport festival's lackluster.

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:45.170
I thought we could do
something about it.

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:48.480
Sensei, you'll be joining us at the
sports festival, won't you?

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:51.150
No, my practice teaching's
already over, so...

00:06:51.150 --> 00:06:52.190
You'll come, won't you?

00:06:52.190 --> 00:06:53.800
All right, all right.

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:56.520
I'd be delighted to come
show my support.

00:06:57.320 --> 00:07:02.280
Be grateful we're sending
you an invitation.

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:06.000
What are you talking about?

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:08.380
Keep up the good work!

00:07:11.790 --> 00:07:15.010
Something's not right
between those two.

00:07:15.010 --> 00:07:17.620
I thought we were investigating
the art club.

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:20.880
Investigating and observing.

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:21.920
I see...

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:24.060
Tomoko-chan!

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:25.590
Hello.

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:28.730
Do you know anything about what's going
on between Elis-chan and Sensei?

00:07:28.730 --> 00:07:31.310
Elis-chan has been staying with me.

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:32.320
With you?

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:36.440
Gotcha!

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:39.010
Congratulations, Tomoko-kun.

00:07:39.010 --> 00:07:43.110
I hereby appoint you our informant!

00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:45.490
What?

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:49.580
Where's the sugar?

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:50.890
Here.

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:53.510
Two tablespoons...

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:55.650
You're putting in that much?

00:07:55.650 --> 00:07:59.180
Yeah. Onii-chan loves sweet eggs.

00:08:02.240 --> 00:08:06.920
Didn't Kiri-sensei say she'd give
you whatever you wanted?

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:10.330
I don't want anything.

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:13.000
Why don't you ask for your Onii-chan?

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:16.440
Don't you think that's too much?

00:08:16.880 --> 00:08:19.200
This is the perfect amount!

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:20.550
Fine, fine.

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:23.100
I definitely won't be eating any.

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:24.380
Suit yourself.

00:08:26.220 --> 00:08:28.390
It should be around here somewhere...

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:30.500
Is this it?

00:08:42.220 --> 00:08:45.120
Where are you now?

00:08:47.740 --> 00:08:51.080
He still hasn't replied.

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:06.410
Incoming Mail

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:06.410
From: Kamikura Hiroki

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:06.410
I'm lounging around the apartment.

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:12.700
Hey.

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:13.680
What's up?

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:16.350
I just thought I'd call.

00:09:16.800 --> 00:09:17.890
What for?

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:20.040
Just because.

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:24.980
The civil servant exam...

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:30.150
I made it up. I was actually at my
grandmother's in Hokkaido.

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:32.870
Was Elis-chan with you?

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:34.370
Yeah.

00:09:35.230 --> 00:09:36.350
I see...

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:44.630
It seems like she's got a lot to think
about regarding studying abroad.

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:46.440
Really...

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:48.600
That's why she's staying
with Fujinami-san.

00:09:49.820 --> 00:09:52.710
I don't know what a girl
her age is thinking.

00:09:52.710 --> 00:09:55.200
You were a lot simpler.

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:56.750
Shut up!

00:09:59.010 --> 00:10:00.640
Don't you have to wake
up early tomorrow?

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:01.610
Yeah.

00:10:01.610 --> 00:10:03.150
I should probably go.

00:10:03.150 --> 00:10:05.750
Yeah. Bye.

00:10:07.590 --> 00:10:10.040
He was willing to tell me that much.

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:14.730
Ow!

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:28.740
Eleventh Nadesico Academy
Sports Festival

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:39.380
Please gather around the entrance.

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:57.330
We're finally approaching the climax!

00:10:57.330 --> 00:11:00.540
The batons are about to be
passed off to the anchors!

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:04.080
And there's the pass!

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:06.040
Can Class A keep their lead?

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:08.400
Will Class B catch up?

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:10.630
The batons are changing hands
one after another.

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:13.320
Sprint to the finish!

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:17.800
Knock it out of the park, Hosen!

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:19.460
I think you've got it wrong.

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:51.180
We were so close!

00:11:51.830 --> 00:11:52.940
Elis...

00:11:54.830 --> 00:11:57.740
On your mark, set...

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:08.900
It is time for lunch.

00:12:09.310 --> 00:12:14.340
The afternoon events will start
after the break at one thirty.

00:12:14.340 --> 00:12:16.800
Where do you want to eat lunch?

00:12:19.330 --> 00:12:20.980
Hey, Elis!

00:12:22.680 --> 00:12:25.380
I prepared too much food.

00:12:25.860 --> 00:12:27.190
Would you like to join us?

00:12:28.520 --> 00:12:31.870
Uh, we also...

00:12:36.870 --> 00:12:41.730
Eat up. You kids are still growing.

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:44.210
I'll eat until I burst.

00:12:44.210 --> 00:12:45.810
You don't need to be eating that much.

00:12:45.810 --> 00:12:49.730
Come on, I'm hungry.

00:12:49.730 --> 00:12:50.850
Go ahead.

00:12:50.850 --> 00:12:52.790
That looks great!

00:12:53.640 --> 00:12:55.020
Eggs...

00:12:55.020 --> 00:12:58.150
Kiri, these eggs...

00:12:58.150 --> 00:13:00.430
Don't worry. I made them sweet.

00:13:00.430 --> 00:13:02.070
Good work.

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:05.030
Elis, don't you like sweet
eggs, too? You...

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:09.130
I'll go buy something to drink.

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:11.940
I've got some sports drinks.

00:13:11.940 --> 00:13:15.970
I'll have some tea. Something
with a lot of catechin.

00:13:15.970 --> 00:13:17.160
Okay.

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:18.720
Do you want me to go with you?

00:13:18.720 --> 00:13:20.040
I'm fine.

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:22.400
Thanks for the food.

00:13:26.850 --> 00:13:29.850
Hosen! That relay was a close one.

00:13:29.850 --> 00:13:30.920
Here!

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:33.520
Is this...

00:13:33.520 --> 00:13:36.310
If you don't need a lunch...

00:13:36.310 --> 00:13:38.610
I need this! I really do!

00:13:38.610 --> 00:13:41.640
Return the box when you're done.

00:13:41.640 --> 00:13:43.530
Thanks.

00:13:46.950 --> 00:13:48.360
Awesome!

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:52.710
Committee Meeting in progress!

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:52.710
Do not enter!!

00:13:50.920 --> 00:13:52.710
I see.

00:13:53.150 --> 00:13:56.200
She's eating lunch with Kiri-sensei.

00:13:57.980 --> 00:14:00.160
Can I go? I'm up next.

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:04.930
Oh, the scavenger hunt.
Give it your best.

00:14:04.930 --> 00:14:05.790
See you later.

00:14:05.790 --> 00:14:06.760
Wait!

00:14:06.760 --> 00:14:08.790
What?

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:11.930
I just had a great idea.

00:14:15.360 --> 00:14:17.870
Are you sure about that?

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:21.670
Nothing's impossible for me.

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:25.810
Scavenger hunt participants,
gather round.

00:14:25.810 --> 00:14:28.340
Where did Tomoko-chan go?

00:14:29.440 --> 00:14:30.880
Tomoko-chan!

00:14:30.880 --> 00:14:33.230
Hurry up!

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:36.800
Tomoko-chan, the referees
have been looking for you.

00:14:36.800 --> 00:14:38.990
It's your turn to get out there.

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:42.120
I don't feel well.

00:14:43.050 --> 00:14:46.880
I don't feel well. My head hurts,
and my stomach hurts.

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:49.250
Really?

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:51.270
You look okay.

00:14:51.270 --> 00:14:54.710
Do the scavenger hunt for me.

00:14:54.710 --> 00:14:56.510
Who, me?

00:14:57.830 --> 00:14:58.680
I'm going to puke.

00:14:58.680 --> 00:15:00.430
All right.

00:15:00.430 --> 00:15:02.740
Make sure you go to the nurse's office!

00:15:02.740 --> 00:15:04.600
Leave this to me.

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:08.280
I'm an actress.

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:10.340
This way.

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:11.420
Okay.

00:15:11.630 --> 00:15:13.540
He doesn't seem to be feeling well.

00:15:14.750 --> 00:15:17.890
Hashizume-kun, is it?

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:19.360
Is something wrong?

00:15:19.360 --> 00:15:21.720
The eggs...

00:15:21.720 --> 00:15:22.930
Eggs?

00:15:22.930 --> 00:15:25.800
I was attacked by sweet eggs.

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:28.110
Wait...

00:15:30.140 --> 00:15:33.170
This is Elis-chan's.

00:15:33.170 --> 00:15:34.370
Hosen-san's?

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:38.560
Excuse me, I'm here for
the scavenger hunt.

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:40.410
Hurry up.

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:42.240
Get in line over there.

00:15:42.240 --> 00:15:42.890
Okay.

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:45.560
Elis-chan?

00:15:45.560 --> 00:15:46.920
Kiri-sensei!

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:51.860
Entrance

00:15:47.310 --> 00:15:49.930
You're participating in the
scavenger hunt,too?

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:54.150
Uh, I'm here for Tomoko-chan.

00:15:54.690 --> 00:15:56.160
What about you?

00:15:56.160 --> 00:15:58.860
I'm here for an absent student, too.

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:01.410
Elis-chan, I...

00:16:03.510 --> 00:16:06.640
We're both pinch hitters.
Let's just have some fun.

00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:09.010
Sure...

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:11.950
Huh?

00:16:14.520 --> 00:16:18.590
Event #18, scavenger hunt.

00:16:18.820 --> 00:16:21.780
On your mark, get set...

00:16:24.140 --> 00:16:27.000
She said it was just for fun!

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:29.950
And they're off!

00:16:29.950 --> 00:16:33.440
No surprise PE teacher Kikyo-sensei
is in the lead.

00:16:40.070 --> 00:16:45.010
Sensei, that's for Elis-chan!

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:53.590
Looks like kids still pull
these kinds of pranks.

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:56.760
Where is it?

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:01.950
Elis-chan?

00:17:02.570 --> 00:17:05.840
Something important

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:07.250
Elis-chan.

00:17:09.680 --> 00:17:10.700
There.

00:17:17.620 --> 00:17:18.840
But...

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:27.910
Elis-chan.

00:17:27.910 --> 00:17:28.590
Yes.

00:17:28.590 --> 00:17:29.890
Go on.

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:33.120
Bye!

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:35.500
Good grief.

00:17:35.500 --> 00:17:38.800
Someone you love

00:17:38.800 --> 00:17:41.620
I need to go talk to those kids.

00:17:44.350 --> 00:17:47.110
You shouldn't include this in there!

00:17:50.780 --> 00:17:51.800
I'm sorry!

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:54.390
This was all Hagino-san's idea!

00:17:54.390 --> 00:17:56.550
Sumire-senpai, how could you?

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:59.250
Why you...

00:18:00.530 --> 00:18:03.490
Sensei, I'm choking! I'm choking!

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:06.780
What's going on, Elis?

00:18:06.780 --> 00:18:08.730
What was written on your paper?

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:09.610
Come.

00:18:11.100 --> 00:18:13.910
Come with me.

00:18:26.470 --> 00:18:28.250
Shall we go for the gold?

00:18:29.060 --> 00:18:30.190
Yeah.

00:18:38.870 --> 00:18:40.310
They've done it!

00:18:40.310 --> 00:18:42.250
Class A has finished!

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:51.760
So, what was on your paper?

00:18:53.080 --> 00:18:56.130
Uh, a stupid teacher.

00:18:56.130 --> 00:18:58.100
What?

00:18:58.100 --> 00:19:02.050
My intelligence aside,
I'm not a teacher yet!

00:19:02.050 --> 00:19:03.910
So you admit you're an idiot.

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:08.830
Aren't you coming home today?

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:12.210
I've got a birthday present for you.

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:18.070
I'll just get my present and leave, then.

00:19:19.570 --> 00:19:21.810
We'll go home together.

00:19:22.740 --> 00:19:23.740
Okay.

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:41.250
You've kept this place pretty clean.

00:19:41.250 --> 00:19:43.170
What are you talking about?

00:19:43.170 --> 00:19:46.160
I was always in charge
of household chores.

00:19:46.390 --> 00:19:47.900
Ouch.

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:54.300
There we go.

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:01.510
Is this...

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:03.280
Impressive, isn't it?

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:06.400
I want to eat this!

00:20:07.050 --> 00:20:10.840
This one. It's yellow and big.

00:20:10.840 --> 00:20:12.980
Onii-chan, make this!

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:16.150
Me? I can't do that...

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:17.630
No, no, no.

00:20:17.630 --> 00:20:20.360
I want to eat it, I want to
eat it, I want to eat it!

00:20:21.170 --> 00:20:23.730
I baked you one then, too...

00:20:24.440 --> 00:20:28.140
but it was a squashed thing
you couldn't call a cake.

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:34.460
What do you think?

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:37.510
Wouldn't you agree I've
come a long way?

00:20:43.670 --> 00:20:44.910
Elis?

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:48.780
I can't eat all of this.

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:51.150
My stomach would burst.

00:20:51.150 --> 00:20:52.630
You can leave some.

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:54.430
No.

00:20:55.560 --> 00:20:58.790
I'll be so full, I can't move.

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:05.540
I can't go back to Tomoko-chan's house.

00:21:09.810 --> 00:21:11.480
I'll make some tea.

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:14.250
Okay.

00:21:22.270 --> 00:21:23.510
Onii-chan.

00:21:25.810 --> 00:21:27.390
It's delicious.

00:23:11.080 --> 00:23:13.800
Evergreen is the color
of eternal paradise.

00:23:14.130 --> 00:23:17.600
A color visible only to children
with pure hearts.

00:23:17.600 --> 00:23:19.000
Hey, Onii-chan...

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:22.110
How do you feel about young girls?

00:23:22.650 --> 00:23:23.680
What do you mean?

00:23:23.680 --> 00:23:25.920
You expect them to behave
like children...

00:23:25.920 --> 00:23:29.970
but they'll touch your heart with
something surprisingly profound.

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:32.460
You're the only kid I need.

00:23:34.060 --> 00:23:36.680
Next episode, “Evergreen Innocence.”

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:39.290
Approach love with a mature heart!
